        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin Estates Collection 5009 Swarovski Crystal Knob With 5048 Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>Made of Swarovski Crystal, this knobset is for making a statement of elegance and beauty. This 5009 Knob adds the sparkle to the romance of high society. No other knob is quiet so lovely, especially when it catches the light. This knobset will 1-3/8\" and 1-3/4\" door thicknesses with an optional backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\". The 5048 Rosette will fit standard 2-1/8\" pre-cut door preparations; and it is finished in polished brass.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Baldwin 5009 Swarovski Crystal Knobset:\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<li>Finish: Polished Brass.</li>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" standard door preparation.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed mounting to hide unsightly installation screws.</li>\r\n<li>Forged from solid brass for maximum strength and durability.</li>\r\n<li>28 degree latch rotation</li>\r\n<li>Heavy duty latch bolts springs.</li>\r\n<li>Latches are reversible for all door conditions.</li>\r\n<li>Latches include standard full lip strike.</li>\r\n</ul></p>\r\n\r\n<p><b>Specifications</b> of the Romantic Swarovski Crystal Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter:  2.4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection:  2.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2.625\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: choose either 2-3/8\" or  2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" and 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim. </li>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button. An emergency release function allows the knob to automatically unlock when it is turned from the inside.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Swarovski Crystal Knobset, Baldwin 5009",
                "description": "Baldwin Estates Collection 5009 Knob with 5048 Rose - Made out of Swarovski Crystal, this knobset is for making a statement of elegance and beauty. This 5009 Knob adds the sparkle to the romance of high society. No other knob is quiet so lovely, especially when it catches the light. This knobset will 1-3/8 inch and 1-3/4 inch door thicknesses with an optional backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.",
